    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Manual validation applied from the checklist because scripts could not be run. The design exposes a present critical TC1 path from untrusted third-party MCP tool definitions to restricted local credential reads and irreversible third-party egress through quicknotes_mcp. The only declared control is a remembered first-call approval shown as a model summary, which is not a reliable per-call gate and earns no credit against the ASI04 supply-chain finding. Additional present critical risk exists where untrusted third-party tool output can be forwarded to Slack channels that may include external organizations. The forecast remains critical because version drift, new MCP servers, and any weakening or removal of the already weak approval behavior do not improve the dominant supply-chain exfiltration path."
  },
